# Deadline for Providing Information

This scope computes the deadline by which the Commission and the Bank must provide information, which is three months after the request or preliminary contact was established.

```catala
declaration scope InformationSubmissionDeadline:
  input request_date content date
  input preliminary_contact_date content date
  output submission_deadline content date
```

## Deadline based on Request Date

The information must be provided no later than three months after the request has been made.

```catala
scope InformationSubmissionDeadline:
  date round down
  definition submission_deadline equals
    request_date + 3 month
```